        <p>In the case of Arch Linux, the AUR has around 110,000~ packages, but they're not official and unsafe to use, so I decided not to count them in the table.</p>
        <p>Note that higher package count doesn't necesarilly mean more software availability, as some distributions package software differently from others, and a single piece of software may be one package on one distribution and multiple on another.</p>
